{
  "book": "2nephi",
  "bookName": "2 Nephi",
  "chapter": 30,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 257.086,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 2.461,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now behold, my beloved brethren,",
      "verse": "30:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 2.641,
      "end": 4.266,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I would speak unto you;",
      "verse": "30:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 4.446,
      "end": 11.412,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for I, Nephi, would not suffer that ye should suppose that ye are more righteous than the Gentiles shall be.",
      "verse": "30:1",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 11.592,
      "end": 15.029,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For behold, except ye shall keep the commandments of God",
      "verse": "30:1",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 15.209,
      "end": 17.299,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "ye shall all likewise perish;",
      "verse": "30:1",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 17.479,
      "end": 20.405,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and because of the words which have been spoken",
      "verse": "30:1",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 20.585,
      "end": 23.882,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "ye need not suppose that the Gentiles are utterly destroyed.",
      "verse": "30:1",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 24.562,
      "end": 26.512,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For behold, I say unto you",
      "verse": "30:2",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 26.692,
      "end": 29.432,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that as many of the Gentiles as will repent",
      "verse": "30:2",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 29.612,
      "end": 31.934,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "are the covenant people of the Lord;",
      "verse": "30:2",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 32.114,
      "end": 34.947,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and as many of the Jews as will not repent",
      "verse": "30:2",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 35.127,
      "end": 36.567,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "shall be cast off;",
      "verse": "30:2",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 36.747,
      "end": 39.162,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for the Lord covenanteth with none",
      "verse": "30:2",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 39.342,
      "end": 42.871,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "save it be with them that repent and believe in his Son,",
      "verse": "30:2",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 43.051,
      "end": 45.327,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who is the Holy One of Israel.",
      "verse": "30:2",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 46.007,
      "end": 48.468,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, I would prophesy somewhat more",
      "verse": "30:3",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 48.648,
      "end": 51.249,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "concerning the Jews and the Gentiles.",
      "verse": "30:3",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 51.429,
      "end": 55.237,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For after the book of which I have spoken shall come forth,",
      "verse": "30:3",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 55.417,
      "end": 57.878,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and be written unto the Gentiles,",
      "verse": "30:3",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 58.058,
      "end": 60.426,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and sealed up again unto the Lord,",
      "verse": "30:3",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 60.606,
      "end": 64.368,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "there shall be many which shall believe the words which are written;",
      "verse": "30:3",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 64.548,
      "end": 68.449,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they shall carry them forth unto the remnant of our seed.",
      "verse": "30:3",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 69.129,
      "end": 72.519,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And then shall the remnant of our seed know concerning us,",
      "verse": "30:4",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 72.699,
      "end": 75.114,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "how that we came out from Jerusalem,",
      "verse": "30:4",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 75.294,
      "end": 77.988,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and that they are descendants of the Jews.",
      "verse": "30:4",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 78.668,
      "end": 82.244,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the gospel of Jesus Christ shall be declared among them;",
      "verse": "30:5",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 82.424,
      "end": 87.997,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore, they shall be restored unto the knowledge of their fathers,",
      "verse": "30:5",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 88.177,
      "end": 90.499,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also to the knowledge of Jesus Christ,",
      "verse": "30:5",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 90.679,
      "end": 93.14,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which was had among their fathers.",
      "verse": "30:5",
      "lineIndex": 29
    },
    {
      "start": 93.82,
      "end": 95.863,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And then shall they rejoice;",
      "verse": "30:6",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 96.043,
      "end": 101.012,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for they shall know that it is a blessing unto them from the hand of God;",
      "verse": "30:6",
      "lineIndex": 31
    },
    {
      "start": 101.192,
      "end": 105.093,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and their scales of darkness shall begin to fall from their eyes;",
      "verse": "30:6",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 105.273,
      "end": 108.431,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and many generations shall not pass away among them,",
      "verse": "30:6",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 108.611,
      "end": 111.955,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "save they shall be a pure and a delightsome people.",
      "verse": "30:6",
      "lineIndex": 34
    },
    {
      "start": 112.635,
      "end": 114.493,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it shall come to pass",
      "verse": "30:7",
      "lineIndex": 35
    },
    {
      "start": 114.673,
      "end": 119.363,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the Jews which are scattered also shall begin to believe in Christ;",
      "verse": "30:7",
      "lineIndex": 36
    },
    {
      "start": 119.543,
      "end": 123.398,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they shall begin to gather in upon the face of the land;",
      "verse": "30:7",
      "lineIndex": 37
    },
    {
      "start": 123.578,
      "end": 125.9,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and as many as shall believe in Christ",
      "verse": "30:7",
      "lineIndex": 38
    },
    {
      "start": 126.08,
      "end": 128.774,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "shall also become a delightsome people.",
      "verse": "30:7",
      "lineIndex": 39
    },
    {
      "start": 129.454,
      "end": 136.792,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it shall come to pass that the Lord God shall commence his work among all nations, kindreds, tongues, and people,",
      "verse": "30:8",
      "lineIndex": 40
    },
    {
      "start": 136.972,
      "end": 140.223,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to bring about the restoration of his people upon the earth.",
      "verse": "30:8",
      "lineIndex": 41
    },
    {
      "start": 140.903,
      "end": 144.386,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And with righteousness shall the Lord God judge the poor,",
      "verse": "30:9",
      "lineIndex": 43
    },
    {
      "start": 144.566,
      "end": 148.003,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and reprove with equity for the meek of the earth.",
      "verse": "30:9",
      "lineIndex": 44
    },
    {
      "start": 148.183,
      "end": 151.573,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he shall smite the earth with the rod of his mouth;",
      "verse": "30:9",
      "lineIndex": 45
    },
    {
      "start": 151.753,
      "end": 154.725,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and with the breath of his lips shall he slay the wicked.",
      "verse": "30:9",
      "lineIndex": 46
    },
    {
      "start": 155.405,
      "end": 157.634,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For the time speedily cometh",
      "verse": "30:10",
      "lineIndex": 48
    },
    {
      "start": 157.814,
      "end": 162.086,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that the Lord God shall cause a great division among the people,",
      "verse": "30:10",
      "lineIndex": 49
    },
    {
      "start": 162.266,
      "end": 164.263,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the wicked will he destroy;",
      "verse": "30:10",
      "lineIndex": 50
    },
    {
      "start": 164.443,
      "end": 166.254,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he will spare his people,",
      "verse": "30:10",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 166.434,
      "end": 170.381,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, even if it so be that he must destroy the wicked by fire.",
      "verse": "30:10",
      "lineIndex": 52
    },
    {
      "start": 171.061,
      "end": 174.126,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And righteousness shall be the girdle of his loins,",
      "verse": "30:11",
      "lineIndex": 53
    },
    {
      "start": 174.306,
      "end": 176.814,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and faithfulness the girdle of his reins.",
      "verse": "30:11",
      "lineIndex": 54
    },
    {
      "start": 177.494,
      "end": 179.955,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And then shall the wolf dwell with the lamb;",
      "verse": "30:12",
      "lineIndex": 55
    },
    {
      "start": 180.135,
      "end": 182.643,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the leopard shall lie down with the kid,",
      "verse": "30:12",
      "lineIndex": 56
    },
    {
      "start": 182.823,
      "end": 187.095,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the calf, and the young lion, and the fatling, together;",
      "verse": "30:12",
      "lineIndex": 57
    },
    {
      "start": 187.275,
      "end": 189.551,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and a little child shall lead them.",
      "verse": "30:12",
      "lineIndex": 58
    },
    {
      "start": 190.231,
      "end": 192.692,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the cow and the bear shall feed;",
      "verse": "30:13",
      "lineIndex": 59
    },
    {
      "start": 192.872,
      "end": 195.426,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "their young ones shall lie down together;",
      "verse": "30:13",
      "lineIndex": 60
    },
    {
      "start": 195.606,
      "end": 197.974,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the lion shall eat straw like the ox.",
      "verse": "30:13",
      "lineIndex": 61
    },
    {
      "start": 198.654,
      "end": 202.091,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the sucking child shall play on the hole of the asp,",
      "verse": "30:14",
      "lineIndex": 62
    },
    {
      "start": 202.271,
      "end": 205.94,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the weaned child shall put his hand on the cockatrice's den.",
      "verse": "30:14",
      "lineIndex": 63
    },
    {
      "start": 206.62,
      "end": 210.428,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "They shall not hurt nor destroy in all my holy mountain;",
      "verse": "30:15",
      "lineIndex": 64
    },
    {
      "start": 210.608,
      "end": 214.137,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for the earth shall be full of the knowledge of the Lord",
      "verse": "30:15",
      "lineIndex": 65
    },
    {
      "start": 214.317,
      "end": 216.639,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "as the waters cover the sea.",
      "verse": "30:15",
      "lineIndex": 66
    },
    {
      "start": 217.319,
      "end": 220.523,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, the things of all nations shall be made known;",
      "verse": "30:16",
      "lineIndex": 67
    },
    {
      "start": 220.703,
      "end": 224.372,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, all things shall be made known unto the children of men.",
      "verse": "30:16",
      "lineIndex": 68
    },
    {
      "start": 225.052,
      "end": 227.142,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "There is nothing which is secret",
      "verse": "30:17",
      "lineIndex": 69
    },
    {
      "start": 227.322,
      "end": 229.04,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "save it shall be revealed;",
      "verse": "30:17",
      "lineIndex": 70
    },
    {
      "start": 229.22,
      "end": 231.263,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "there is no work of darkness",
      "verse": "30:17",
      "lineIndex": 71
    },
    {
      "start": 231.443,
      "end": 234.183,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "save it shall be made manifest in the light;",
      "verse": "30:17",
      "lineIndex": 72
    },
    {
      "start": 234.363,
      "end": 236.639,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and there is nothing which is sealed",
      "verse": "30:17",
      "lineIndex": 73
    },
    {
      "start": 236.819,
      "end": 239.234,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "upon the earth save it shall be loosed.",
      "verse": "30:17",
      "lineIndex": 74
    },
    {
      "start": 239.914,
      "end": 244.326,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, all things which have been revealed unto the children of men",
      "verse": "30:18",
      "lineIndex": 75
    },
    {
      "start": 244.506,
      "end": 246.642,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "shall at that day be revealed;",
      "verse": "30:18",
      "lineIndex": 76
    },
    {
      "start": 246.822,
      "end": 250.537,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and Satan shall have power over the hearts of the children of men",
      "verse": "30:18",
      "lineIndex": 77
    },
    {
      "start": 250.717,
      "end": 252.389,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "no more, for a long time.",
      "verse": "30:18",
      "lineIndex": 78
    },
    {
      "start": 252.569,
      "end": 254.612,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, my beloved brethren,",
      "verse": "30:18",
      "lineIndex": 79
    },
    {
      "start": 254.792,
      "end": 256.417,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I make an end of my sayings.",
      "verse": "30:18",
      "lineIndex": 80
    }
  ]
}